{"audio": "1john-04.opus", "duration_ms": 165958, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 0, "end_ms": 3440, "text": "1 John, Chapter Four."}, {"start_ms": 4641, "end_ms": 9381, "text": "Beloved, do not believe every spirit, but test the spirits to see whether they are from God."}, {"start_ms": 9981, "end_ms": 12541, "text": "For many false prophets have gone out into the world."}, {"start_ms": 13141, "end_ms": 23923, "text": "By this you will know the Spirit of God: Every spirit that confesses that Jesus Christ has come in the flesh is from God, and every spirit that does not confess Jesus is not from God."}, {"start_ms": 24743, "end_ms": 30583, "text": "This is the spirit of the antichrist, which you have heard is coming and which is already in the world at this time."}, {"start_ms": 31483, "end_ms": 38284, "text": "You, little children, are from God and have overcome them, because greater is He who is in you than he who is in the world."}, {"start_ms": 39184, "end_ms": 40284, "text": "They are of the world."}, {"start_ms": 40604, "end_ms": 44545, "text": "That is why they speak from the world’s perspective, and the world listens to them."}, {"start_ms": 45245, "end_ms": 46265, "text": "We are from God."}, {"start_ms": 46705, "end_ms": 51486, "text": "Whoever knows God listens to us; whoever is not from God does not listen to us."}, {"start_ms": 52086, "end_ms": 55466, "text": "That is how we know the Spirit of truth and the spirit of deception."}, {"start_ms": 56306, "end_ms": 59726, "text": "Beloved, let us love one another, because love comes from God."}, {"start_ms": 60207, "end_ms": 63227, "text": "Everyone who loves has been born of God and knows God."}, {"start_ms": 63887, "end_ms": 67987, "text": "Whoever does not love does not know God, because God is love."}, {"start_ms": 69047, "end_ms": 76808, "text": "This is how God’s love was revealed among us: God sent His one and only Son into the world, so that we might live through Him."}, {"start_ms": 77528, "end_ms": 85689, "text": "And love consists in this: not that we loved God, but that He loved us and sent His Son as the atoning sacrifice for our sins."}, {"start_ms": 86549, "end_ms": 90290, "text": "Beloved, if God so loved us, we also ought to love one another."}, {"start_ms": 90850, "end_ms": 97711, "text": "No one has ever seen God; but if we love one another, God remains in us, and His love is perfected in us."}, {"start_ms": 98651, "end_ms": 103811, "text": "By this we know that we remain in Him, and He in us: He has given us of His Spirit."}, {"start_ms": 104571, "end_ms": 109312, "text": "And we have seen and testify that the Father has sent His Son to be the Savior of the world."}, {"start_ms": 110232, "end_ms": 116173, "text": "If anyone confesses that Jesus is the Son of God, God abides in him, and he in God."}, {"start_ms": 116693, "end_ms": 120193, "text": "And we have come to know and believe the love that God has for us."}, {"start_ms": 120913, "end_ms": 125674, "text": "God is love; whoever abides in love abides in God, and God in him."}, {"start_ms": 126694, "end_ms": 134675, "text": "In this way, love has been perfected among us, so that we may have confidence on the day of judgment; for in this world we are just like Him."}, {"start_ms": 135315, "end_ms": 140655, "text": "There is no fear in love, but perfect love drives out fear, because fear involves punishment."}, {"start_ms": 141115, "end_ms": 143876, "text": "The one who fears has not been perfected in love."}, {"start_ms": 144596, "end_ms": 147376, "text": "We love because He first loved us."}, {"start_ms": 148136, "end_ms": 152497, "text": "If anyone says, “I love God,” but hates his brother, he is a liar."}, {"start_ms": 153117, "end_ms": 158717, "text": "For anyone who does not love his brother, whom he has seen, cannot love God, whom he has not seen."}, {"start_ms": 159537, "end_ms": 164478, "text": "And we have this commandment from Him: Whoever loves God must love his brother as well."}], "words": 